{"id":"637839","name":"芝士土豆饼","author":"DetectⅰviCoano","authorId":"12779990","desc":"","cover":"images/637839/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝士","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备几个土豆，削皮。","img":"images/637839/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把土豆放进蒸锅。","img":"images/637839/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"能轻轻用勺子戳破就可以了。","img":"images/637839/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把土豆打碎。","img":"images/637839/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放进适量的糯米粉，也可以边放边搅拌。","img":"images/637839/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后用手搓成圆形，后面搓成一个个小的圆形。","img":"images/637839/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备芝士。","img":"images/637839/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把圆球压扁。","img":"images/637839/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"里面放上芝士。","img":"images/637839/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后搓成圆形。","img":"images/637839/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/637839/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"起锅烧油，等油热啦。","img":"images/637839/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放下土豆饼，两面都煎一下，然后再煎一下四周。","img":"images/637839/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"最后撒上芝士。","img":"images/637839/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"完美。","img":"images/637839/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"一定要把土豆切薄一点，好蒸，不然要蒸很久。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}